_pdbx_entry_details.compound_details           
;CHAIN P IS A EPITOPE PEPTIDE WITH THE SEQUENCE
 VAL-VAL-SER-HIS-PHE-ASN-ASP, DERIVED FROM THE N-TERMINUS OF
 TGFALPHA.
 CHAIN L, M: THE C-TERMINAL REGION IS THE CONSTANT REGION OF
 THE IG KAPPA LIGHT CHAIN. THE N-TERMINAL REGION IS THE
 VARIABLE REGION OF THE IG KAPPA LIGHT CHAIN. THE VARIABLE
 REGION IS AUTOANTIBODY REACTIVE WITH SPECTRIN,
 (4-HYRDOXY-3-NITROPHENYL) ACETYL, AND FLUORESCEIN, WHICH
 PROMOTES CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM REMYELINATION
;
